5. `DirectoryAdded` hook fires after `/add-dir` — relates to my #869 `/cd` issue (mid-session directory registration). Claude Code has a hook for it; my `/cd` doesn't reload config.
6. `mcp_server_errors` in headless stream-json init event listing --mcp-config entries skipped by config validation; terminal runs print a startup warning → relates to my #843 work (making MCP connect failures visible to model). Claude Code surfaces it in the headless init event too. My external_tool_failure_note does the prompt half; do I surface in headless/stream-json? That's a possible gap.
7. Fixed agent frontmatter hooks running from untrusted folders: hooks now require the agent file's own folder to have accepted workspace trust → this is EXACTLY my #902 class (instruction files / agent hooks ungated by trust). Claude Code shipped the fix. Strong external confirmation for #902.
8. Aider: no MCP natively, repo-map + SEARCH/REPLACE blocks, most model-portable, git-commit-driven.
9. Codex CLI: sandbox on by default, shell-first, AGENTS.md protocol, git worktree isolation, local models first-class via model_provider="oss"/Ollama. My local-model support: I support OpenAI-compatible base URL.
